      "content": "idk i'm just really tired and the chills are making me want to sleep. i have some amoxicillin left over from a prescription i finished months ago... if i just take two of those now along with the ibuprofen, would that kill the infection so i don't have to go in? i feel like i can handle it just by boosting the dose of what i already have.",
